# Plaintext SOPS vault — NEVER committed. The ENCRYPTED version is committed
# deliberately via `git add -f infra/secrets/prod.env` after `sops -e -i`
# (the standard SOPS pattern). A pre-commit hook blocks accidental plaintext
# commits. Edit the vault with `sops infra/secrets/prod.env` (in-memory
# decrypt/re-encrypt) or `sops set ...` — never keep a plaintext copy.
infra/secrets/prod.env
